A cyberpunk cityscape at night where three massive holographic skyscrapers tower over a neon-drenched metropolis, each building constructed from glowing data streams and floating spreadsheet grids that dissolve into particles as they rise. In the foreground, a lone figure stands on a rain-slicked rooftop, watching as the rigid corporate towers crumble at their edges, transforming into flowing rivers of light that merge into an interconnected web of smaller, organic-looking data nodes scattered across the horizon. The color palette features deep electric blues, hot magentas, and toxic greens reflecting off wet surfaces. Tiny drones carrying document fragments buzz between structures while the sky displays fragmented dashboard interfaces and wiki-like interconnected pathways replacing the old monolithic systems.
